    "text": "Pakistan karega IAEA nuclear security network ki salana meeting ki mezbani! 🇵🇰\nDawn ke mutabiq Foreign Office ne Sunday ko bataya ke Pakistan IAEA ke sath mil kar Islamabad mein 23 se 26 November tak International Network for Nuclear Security Training and Support Centres (NSSC Network) ki 15vi salana meeting ki mezbani karega. Is chaar roza meeting mein IAEA ke numainde aur 49 rukn mumalik shirkat karenge. Pakistan ne 2016 mein bhi yeh meeting karwai thi, jab yeh pehli baar Vienna mein IAEA headquarters se bahar hui thi.\nKya aisi meetings se Pakistan ka aalmi naam roshan hota hai? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #IAEA #NuclearSecurity #Islamabad #PakistanNews",
